  "worked_solution": "The difference of squares formula is given by\n\n$$\n{a}^{2}-{b}^{2}=(a+b)(a-b)\n$$\n\nNotice that our expression can be written as a difference of squares:\n\n$$\n81{m}^{4}-{n}^{4}={(9{m}^{2})}^{2}-{({n}^{2})}^{2}\n$$\n\nNow, we factor our expression using the difference of squares formula:\n\n$$\n{(9{m}^{2})}^{2}-{({n}^{2})}^{2}=(9{m}^{2}+{n}^{2})(9{m}^{2}-{n}^{2})\n$$\n\nFinally, we notice that the expression in the second set of parentheses is also a difference of squares: \n\n$$\n9{m}^{2}-{n}^{2}={(3m)}^{2}-{n}^{2}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the expression can be factored further, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(9{m}^{2}+{n}^{2})(9{m}^{2}-{n}^{2}) & =(9{m}^{2}+{n}^{2})(3m+n)(3m-n)\\end{aligned}\n$$",
